repository root. They are copies of publicly available works by Marc
Lackenby. Copyright remains with the author; each item is subject to its own terms:

1. quasipolynomial-talk.pdf
   Marc Lackenby, "Unknot recognition in quasi-polynomial time", lecture
   slides, February 2021, 109 pages.
   Copyright 2021 Marc Lackenby. No license is stated by the author; the
   file is redistributed here for reference only, and all rights are
   reserved by the author.
   Available at https://people.maths.ox.ac.uk/lackenby/quasipolynomial-talk.pdf

2. arXiv-2607.23350v1/
   Marc Lackenby, "Incompressible surfaces, hierarchies and unknot
   recognition", arXiv:2607.23350v1, 25 July 2026: the arXiv source
   (algorithm-incompressible-250726.tex and .bbl), the figure PDFs, and the
   arXiv-generated PDF renamed from 2607.23350v1.pdf to
   algorithm-incompressible-250726.pdf.
   Copyright 2026 Marc Lackenby. Distributed under the license selected by
   the author on arXiv (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International,
   CC BY 4.0, according to the arXiv listing at the time of copying).
   Available at https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.23350
